      <li><a href="https://www.cityofdekalb.com/1329/Department-Policies">DeKalb Police — Department Policies</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.cityofdekalb.com/DocumentCenter/View/16496/40712---Small-Unmanned-Aircraft-Systems">DeKalb Police — UAS Policy 407.12</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://dekalbcountyilsheriff.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Policy-606-Unmanned_Aerial_System__UAS__Operations.pdf">DeKalb County Sheriff — UAS Policy 606</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://agency.icjia-api.cloud/uploads/SFY_24_Drone_Report_with_Appendices_491dfa4810.pdf">Illinois SFY 2024 Freedom from Drone Surveillance Act report</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.cityofdekalb.com/1328/Voluntary-Camera-Registration-Program">DeKalb Police — Voluntary Camera Registration Program</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <p class="eyebrow">UNRESOLVED</p>
    <h2>Not established by the published records.</h2>
    <ul class="about_questions">
      <li>Whether the 2026 Flock service replaces, integrates with, or operates alongside remaining Genetec fixed readers.</li>
      <li>The current Flock camera count, locations, retention, sharing settings, authorized-user count, and audit results.</li>
      <li>Which Axon Fusus modules and external video sources are configured, rather than merely licensed.</li>
      <li>Current drone models, payloads, complete flight records, retention, and mutual-aid use.</li>
      <li>Current Sheriff's Office ALPR contracts, policies, and network access.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</main>
</BaseLayout>
